Z||000000||8Ball||09-30-2001||01:43 PM||||Well as some of you know Monday I put BOTH my cars in the shop. Helped the mechanic all day monday to offset my bill some. Well it is now sunday and nothing has been done. He FINALLY looked at the hyundai late friday night after I called and pitched a fit that he had not touched the cars. He also promised me that the Fiero would be running this weekend. Well I borrowed my moms car and went to his house ( his garage is behind his house) The Fiero is sitting exactly where I parked it monday morning and now has a flat tire. He has not so much as looked at it!!!! I am an On-Site PC/Network tech I HAVE to have a car to do my job. This guy is killing me!!! What can I do? He won't return my calls, he won't let me know anything, and he won't keep up his end of the bargain!!!<BR>Does anyone know of anything I can do?<BR>The Fiero should take him no time to fix. it is a coolant leak at the water pump. I think I screwed sumtin up when I put it on. Who knows but for crying out loud I know exactly where the leak is and he still will not fix it!!!<P>ARGH!!!! I can't stand crap like this.<P>Sad and carless,<BR>Randy||||reg||1
