Z||000008||thomas_l||10-01-2001||09:19 AM||||Get a tow truck to haul them outta there. If you're lucky, he still hasn't started and the cars will be intact.<P>Having done side work in my last career as a mechanic, it pisses me off when people do that. It gives the legit people a bad rap  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">||||reg||4
Z||000009||NEPTUNE||10-01-2001||09:41 AM|||| I predict:when he finally does get around to working on your cars he will take a long time and do a crappy job, he will scratch your paint, stain your seats /carpet. OBVIOUSLY he does not want to  be bothered with your weird little cars.  A TOW BILL IS CHUMP CHANGE compared to the problems this clown can cause you. <BR>HAVE THE CARS TOWED AWAY RIGHT NOW! <BR> He may be OK with pickup trucks, but this shop will never fix your Fiero right.||||reg||4
